OL,3,GNEWSASingle mum gives up #900 a month
OL,4,Ato follow her dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FA single mother took a #900 a month pay
OL,7,Fcut so she could follow her dream of
OL,8,Fgaining a degree in psychology and
OL,9,Fcriminology.
OL,11,FSadie French, 30, who lives in East
OL,12,FAnglia, faced a troubled childhood and
OL,13,Fhad struggles in adulthood that meant
OL,14,Fshe had to leave her home with her
OL,15,Fdaughter.
OL,17,FWhile she had a finance job, she
OL,18,Fdecided to risk her career and retrain
OL,19,Fat West Suffolk College in Bury St
OL,20,FEdmunds from where she had recently
OL,21,Fgraduated.
